WEBVTT

00:02.855 --> 00:03.316
Hmm.

00:54.009 --> 01:01.942
Yeah.

01:26.930 --> 01:31.492
I was tired of the chaos. I was sick of all the

01:31.572 --> 01:37.515
noise. The messy little glitches of these human

01:37.615 --> 01:43.677
girls and boys. But a kingdom needs a ruler with

01:43.717 --> 01:49.420
an iron-coated fist to systematically delete

01:49.460 --> 01:51.781
the names upon his list.

01:54.591 --> 01:56.491
And thought they could outplay me How

01:56.551 --> 01:59.172
delightfully naive I'm weaving purple runes

01:59.212 --> 02:04.493
That they could not begin to weave By the power of

02:04.533 --> 02:10.054
the Grand Decree The Dream Kingdom belongs to me

02:10.534 --> 02:13.535
Every pixel, every byte Will surrender to the

02:13.615 --> 02:18.496
night When I rewrite the entire directory

02:19.136 --> 02:23.497
Oh, bow to the Grand Decree

02:37.136 --> 02:39.638
I have taken the apprentice, I have bent his

02:39.678 --> 02:42.561
little mind I've severed all the messy little

02:42.601 --> 02:45.924
ties he left behind When the ceremony finishes,

02:46.124 --> 02:48.986
the glitch will be erased And a perfect flawless

02:49.126 --> 02:52.069
order will be finally embraced There is nowhere

02:52.109 --> 02:55.091
left to hide inside this crumbling domain I will

02:55.151 --> 02:59.255
format every memory and rule the silent realm

03:01.821 --> 03:05.663
By the power of the Grand Decree! The Dream

03:05.723 --> 03:10.444
Kingdom belongs to me! Every pixel, every byte

03:10.624 --> 03:13.465
will surrender to the night when I rewrite the

03:13.565 --> 03:16.826
entire directory!

03:17.646 --> 03:22.308
Oh, bow to the Grand Decree!

03:33.707 --> 03:33.975
Bye!

04:14.302 --> 04:17.743
Look at the peasants trembling down below They

04:17.843 --> 04:21.304
cling to the light, but the light has to go Their

04:21.344 --> 04:24.724
messy emotions, their analog tears Will be

04:24.744 --> 04:31.646
swept from the server and erased from the years

04:32.026 --> 04:38.448
Fools, they think a simple medallion can stop me

04:47.523 --> 04:52.486
to the grand decree.

